&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/ColorOS16?type=0&quot;&gt;#ColorOS16#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/NAS?type=0&quot;&gt;#NAS#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E9%A3%9E%E7%89%9B%E7%A7%81%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%91fnOS?type=0&quot;&gt;#飞牛私有云fnOS#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/0f09b97253b7710f5212e96e6a49c99b.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/296c79d21fd53226245f0515c1e27915.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/024f22ffc49788fd09a900e050a791c9.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/750d0ab4e4add55aadb47f0caa039449.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/f031dda991b175f0d5ada1ef5af76f48.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/3ea61c53e7e3749eb7cf62b57d7123ff.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72183837</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72183837</guid><pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 17:02:28 GMT</pubDate><author>缘氏</author></item><item><title>#机箱# 有没有，能放17x17的itx主板，单风扇全高显卡，sfx电源，120 67散热器，两个sata硬盘，两个3.5机械 的尽量的小机箱[流汗滑稽][受虐滑稽] 本来买了个NAS机...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E6%9C%BA%E7%AE%B1?type=0&quot;&gt;#机箱#&lt;/a&gt; 有没有，能放17x17的itx主板，单风扇全高显卡，sfx电源，120 67散热器，两个sata硬盘，两个3.5机械
